# Launchpad components

Before building custom buttons, text, modals, tabs, or alerts, check Launchpad.

- Import from `@moonpig/launchpad-components` (or `@moonpig/launchpad-forms` for form fields).
- Use Tailwind on wrapper elements for layout and spacing — not on Launchpad internals.
- Do **not** add `GlobalStyle` — the app uses `LaunchpadShell` and `src/index.css` instead.
- Look up props in Storybook (https://docs.launchpad.moonpig.io) or `node_modules/@moonpig/launchpad-components/dist/types/index.d.ts`.

Full guide: [docs/LAUNCHPAD.md](../../docs/LAUNCHPAD.md)
